00:07:42.781 --> 00:07:44.615
THEN OF COURSE HE HAS TO GO BACK

00:07:44.616 --> 00:07:46.818
AND SAY WERE NOT GOING TO TAKE

00:07:46.819 --> 00:07:48.019
AWAY MONEY FROM SPECIAL OLYMPICS

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:49.654
BECAUSE THAT WAS SO AWFUL AND

00:07:49.655 --> 00:07:50.988
TOXIC.

00:07:50.989 --> 00:07:52.824
YOU HAD REPUBLICANS, ROY BLUNT

00:07:52.825 --> 00:07:54.559
OF MISSOURI, SAYING IT'S

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:54.959
DEPLORABLE.

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:55.460
OH, MY GOD.

00:07:55.461 --> 00:07:58.062
THIS IS TRUMP ON A VICTORY LAP?

00:07:58.063 --> 00:08:00.565
THIS IS TRUMP SEEKING FURTHER

00:08:00.566 --> 00:08:01.365
INTO THE MOCK.

00:08:01.366 --> 00:08:02.967
&gt;&gt; Jesse: I DON'T THINK HE IS

00:08:02.968 --> 00:08:03.935
SINKING.

00:08:03.936 --> 00:08:05.803
I THINK THE POLL NUMBERS AS YOU

00:08:05.804 --> 00:08:08.239
LIKE TO CITE, WILL POP UP BIG

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:08.539
TIME.

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:09.974
&gt;&gt; Juan: THEY HAVEN'T POPPED

00:08:09.975 --> 00:08:11.809
YET.

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:12.810
&gt;&gt; Jesse: THEY HAVEN'T EVEN

00:08:12.811 --> 00:08:13.578
POLLED.

00:08:13.579 --> 00:08:16.214
THERE HAVE BEEN SNAP HOLES AFTER

00:08:16.215 --> 00:08:20.651
THE MUELLER REPORT CAME OUT?

00:08:20.652 --> 00:08:22.954
&gt;&gt; Dana: I THINK IT'S TOO

00:08:22.955 --> 00:08:23.254
SOON.

00:08:23.255 --> 00:08:25.690
&gt;&gt; Juan: WE HAVEN'T SEEN THEM

00:08:25.691 --> 00:08:26.124
MOLAR REPORT.

00:08:26.125 --> 00:08:27.225
&gt;&gt; Jesse: I URGE YOU TO GIVE

00:08:27.226 --> 00:08:29.660
IT SOME TIME AND YOU'LL SEE THE

00:08:29.661 --> 00:08:30.962
NUMBERS.

00:08:30.963 --> 00:08:32.830
&gt;&gt; Jedediah: IF THE MUELLER

00:08:32.831 --> 00:08:34.232
REPORT COMES OUT AND SAYS

00:08:34.233 --> 00:08:36.200
THERE'S NO COLLUSION, NO

00:08:36.201 --> 00:08:37.401
OBSTRUCTION, WOULD THAT SATISFY

00:08:37.402 --> 00:08:37.668
YOU?

00:08:37.669 --> 00:08:40.071
&gt;&gt; Juan: I AM DYING FOR IT.

00:08:40.072 --> 00:08:41.472
YESTERDAY ON HANNITY THE

00:08:41.473 --> 00:08:42.173
PRESIDENT SAYING I'M GOING TO

00:08:42.174 --> 00:08:44.375
PUT OUT --

00:08:44.376 --> 00:08:45.776
IF THAT'S WHAT YOU THINK IS

00:08:45.777 --> 00:08:48.012
APPROPRIATE, PUT IT OUT.

00:08:48.013 --> 00:08:48.779
HOW ABOUT PARDONS?

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:52.851
TALKING ABOUT PARDONING PEOPLE.

